  "next_step_if_probe_passes": "Preregister a separate 2017-2021 all-team-game locator/chronology audit. It must prove source discoverability and snapshot freshness for all 2,592 team-game partitions before any roster-membership reconstruction is attempted. Transactions between snapshot timestamp and kickoff, including standard elevations and reserve activations, must be handled in a separate frozen chronology layer.",
